&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;a name=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/git-bug/git-bug&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;git-bug&lt;/a&gt; is a standalone, distributed,
offline-first issue management tool that embeds issues, comments, and more as
objects in a git repository (&lt;em&gt;not files!&lt;/em&gt;), enabling you to push and pull them
to one or more remotes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- mdformat-toc start --slug=github --maxlevel=6 --minlevel=2 --&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; &gt;Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#key-features&#34; &gt;Key Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#getting-started&#34; &gt;Getting Started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#our-community&#34; &gt;Our Community&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#backers-star&#34; &gt;Backers :star:&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#sponsors-star2&#34; &gt;Sponsors :star2:&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
