&lt;!-- mdformat-toc end --&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;key-features&#34;&gt;Key Features&lt;a name=&#34;key-features&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native Git Storage:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage issues, users, and comments directly within
your repository - keeping everything versioned and clutter-free&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed &amp;amp; Versioned:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage Git’s decentralized architecture to work
offline and sync seamlessly later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lightning Fast:&lt;/strong&gt; List and search issues in mere &lt;em&gt;milliseconds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Third-Party Bridges:&lt;/strong&gt; Easily synchronize issues with platforms like GitHub
and GitLab &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./doc/usage/third-party.md&#34; &gt;using bridges&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Choose how you interact - via CLI, TUI, or a web
browser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effortless Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Start managing issues your repository with minimal
setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started&lt;a name=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:triangular_flag_on_post: &lt;strong&gt;Install:&lt;/strong&gt; Check out
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./INSTALLATION.md&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;//:INSTALLATION.md&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for step-by-step installation instructions
or explore &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/git-bug/git-bug/releases/latest&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the latest release&lt;/a&gt; to get started immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:page_with_curl: &lt;strong&gt;Explore:&lt;/strong&gt; Read &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./doc&#34; &gt;the documentation&lt;/a&gt; to learn how to
use &lt;code&gt;git-bug&lt;/code&gt; effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:computer: &lt;strong&gt;Contribute:&lt;/strong&gt; Interested in hacking on &lt;code&gt;git-bug&lt;/code&gt;? Head over to
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;//:CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and see how you can help shape the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:speech_balloon: &lt;strong&gt;Connect:&lt;/strong&gt; Chat with us live on Matrix at
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://matrix.to/#/#git-bug:matrix.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;#git-bug:matrix.org&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:books: &lt;strong&gt;Discuss:&lt;/strong&gt; Browse &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/git-bug/git-bug/discussions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;existing discussions&lt;/a&gt; or
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/git-bug/git-bug/discussions/new/choose&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;start a new one&lt;/a&gt; to ask questions and share ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;our-community&#34;&gt;Our Community&lt;a name=&#34;our-community&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
