independent &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opencollective.com/git-bug&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;backers&lt;/a&gt;, and the strategic support of our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opencollective.com/git-bug&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;sponsors&lt;/a&gt;. Each
of you plays a crucial role in our journey, and we deeply appreciate every
contribution that helps drive our project forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opencollective.com/git-bug&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
